00:46:23.881 --> 00:46:25.916
structures that are
very hard to undo.

00:46:25.916 --> 00:46:28.685 align:start size:97% position:3%
May, I mean, don't necessarily
want a total revolution,

00:46:30.120 --> 00:46:32.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
but there are all these
ways that we're in a place

00:46:32.823 --> 00:46:34.191
